[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5542357684","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123193#issuecomment-5542357684","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123193","id":5542357684,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSlmqtA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T15:01:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T15:10:08Z","body":"This doesn't seem to be the cause of the bug, overriding the method isn't changing anything, it seems more like you emitting `changed` causes this\n\nHowever I'd say it's expected for this to happen when emitting the `changed` signal, which isn't really meant to be called by scripts manually, emitting built-in signals manually isn't generally supported","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5542357684/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5542525771","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123193#issuecomment-5542525771","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123193","id":5542525771,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSlw7Sw","user":{"login":"GiacomoPope","id":44242839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQyODM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44242839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope","html_url":"https://github.com/GiacomoPope","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T15:12:54Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T15:12:54Z","body":"```gdscript\n@tool\nextends TileMapLayer\n\nsignal cells_updated(coords: Array)\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tchanged.connect(_on_changed)\n\tcells_updated.connect(_on_cells_changed)\n\t\nfunc _update_cells(coords: Array[Vector2i], forced_cleanup: bool) -> void:\n\tif not forced_cleanup:\n\t\tcells_updated.emit(coords)\n\t\nfunc _on_changed() -> void:\n\tprint(\"TileMapLayer has changed\")\n\nfunc _on_cells_changed(_coords: Array[Vector2i]) -> void:\n\tprint(\"Cells have changed\")\n```\n\nYes you are right, if I do this instead with a custom signal things work, so the issue is calling `changed` and it somehow deselecting the terrain (which i think is still a bug, but a weirder one?)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5542525771/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5542547500","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123193#issuecomment-5542547500","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123193","id":5542547500,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSlyQLA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T15:14:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T15:14:27Z","body":"Then that's not a bug but expected I'd say, and pretty clear proof that the signal is designed to not emit when changing cells\n\nI don't see a bug here, the editor is reset when the properties of the tile map are changed to ensure a valid state, as it can't ensure the tile set is the same etc.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5542547500/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5542613730","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123193#issuecomment-5542613730","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123193","id":5542613730,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSl2S4g","user":{"login":"GiacomoPope","id":44242839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQyODM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44242839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope","html_url":"https://github.com/GiacomoPope","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T15:19:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T15:19:04Z","body":"So this bug doesnt happen in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123191, which i tested locally. \n\nBut, it is simply calling the .connect() in gdscript:\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends TileMapLayer\n\n@onready var timer: Timer = $Timer\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tchanged.connect(_on_changed)\n\ttimer.timeout.connect(_on_timer_timeout)\n\ttimer.start()\n\nfunc _on_changed() -> void:\n\tprint(\"TileMapLayer has changed\")\n\t\nfunc _on_timer_timeout() -> void:\n\tchanged.emit()\n```\n\nThank you for renaming the issue","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5542613730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5542636152","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123193#issuecomment-5542636152","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123193","id":5542636152,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSl3qeA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T15:20:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T15:20:36Z","body":"That would need to be tested, as that PR should cause the same effect, how did 